        "id": 227819,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-06-11T20:34:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I took notes this time! :D</p>\n<p>Where's the art everyone's referencing for the new SHS? c.c</p>\n<p>Doing without a gimmick? Do you know what podcast this is?</p>\n<p>I'm impressed by how much of an impression Princess Cool has made on not just Christopher and Adam, but the entire Letters Page community. XD</p>\n<p>I hear \"luck antenna\" and all I can think of is Xtreme Apostate's blood antenna, and I really have no idea where my mind is going with this but it is going.</p>\n<p>Re-Volt didn't get a \"shut up\": This reinforces my idea that he is a precious (evil) cinnamon roll who must be protected at any cost. Seriously, I feel really bad for him, for all that I'm sure he deserves at least a modicum of pain for all the pain he's caused others.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:02:06.003Z",
