        "raw": "<p>I took notes this time! :D</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Where's the art everyone's referencing for the new SHS? c.c</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Doing without a gimmick? Do you know what podcast this is?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I'm impressed by how much of an impression Princess Cool has made on not just Christopher and Adam, but the entire Letters Page community. XD</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I hear \"luck antenna\" and all I can think of is Xtreme Apostate's blood antenna, and I really have no idea where my mind is going with this but it is going.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Re-Volt didn't get a \"shut up\": This reinforces my idea that he is a precious (evil) cinnamon roll who must be protected at any cost. Seriously, I feel really bad for him, for all that I'm sure he deserves at least a modicum of pain for all the pain he's caused others.</p>",
